y brief period of time, without regard to whether any Chinese-owned car producers were currently exporting cars from Mexico in anticipation of possible future imports.", "url": "https://digitalcommons.wcl.american.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=2167&context=auilr", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Increased U.S. tariffs", "exporting_country": "Mexico"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_6c22797cf4ac982425bb175e", "claim_ids": ["claim_369d21034369afb10af06fa4", "claim_cffdafb55bf6b8e5080ed314"], "query_ids": ["q_382"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_369d21034369afb10af06fa4", "quote": "assembly of battery cells into battery packs does not result in a substantial transformation", "url": "https://rulings.cbp.gov/ruling/H316389", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_cffdafb55bf6b8e5080ed314", "quote": "The battery modules are manufactured into battery packs containing multiple battery modules. Both the battery modules and battery packs are assembled in Canada through multi-step assembly processes that include: applying adhesive, aligning, pressing, curing, plasma cleaning, laser ablation, wire bonding, material", "url": "https://www.cmtradelaw.com/2023/01/customs-ruling-of-the-week-country-of-origin-of-battery-modules-and-battery-packs-and-the-applicability-of-certain-trade-remedies-under-section-301", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_a0e7efdfb99a5e9bb137be37", "claim_ids": ["claim_05085d399182ad5430aab4d7", "claim_2c1a41ac0cca30e4eb62405e"], "query_ids": ["q_383"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_05085d399182ad5430aab4d7", "quote": "Lithium-ion EV batteries – August 1, 2024, increase from 7.5% to 25%", "url": "https://www.millercanfield.com/resources-USTR-Starts-New-Section-301-Tariffs.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301 tariffs", "affected_product": "Lithium-ion EV batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "August 1, 2024"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_2c1a41ac0cca30e4eb62405e", "quote": "Lithium-ion electrical vehicle batteries—Increase rate to 25% in 2024", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2024/09/18/2024-21217/notice-of-modification-chinas-acts-policies-and-practices-related-to-technology-transfer", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"affected_product": "Lithium-ion electrical vehicle batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "2024"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_cb2305bb82e15e089a4b669d", "claim_ids": ["claim_05085d399182ad5430aab4d7", "claim_99cf6bfc77bfa6375d98efcb"], "query_ids": ["q_383"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_05085d399182ad5430aab4d7", "quote": "Lithium-ion EV batteries – August 1, 2024, increase from 7.5% to 25%", "url": "https://www.millercanfield.com/resources-USTR-Starts-New-Section-301-Tariffs.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301 tariffs", "affected_product": "Lithium-ion EV batteries", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "August 1, 2024"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_99cf6bfc77bfa6375d98efcb", "quote": "the USTR delayed the 25% tariff on 'non-EV' lithium-ion batteries until 2026.", "url": "https://energy-solutions.co/policy-intelligence/trade-and-tariffs/us-section-301-tariffs-ev-batteries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"legal_authority": "USTR", "duty_rate": "25%", "effective_date": "2026", "reported_policy_status": "delayed"}}]}]}

